    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c384a06c752a506b46c58387",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个。比赛内容是『比一比谁能最快吃完，\n训练员亲手做的10公斤料理』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e04f96fb02931ffc041f3716cdc9995d66b225e16c4be5de5918cfa527314b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
      "json_path": [
