      "uid": "zhcn:d2d2dee64792c27f3eaf281c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起，我会想办法回绝的。\n不能给训练员增添这种负担。\n不受欢迎的项目，应该还有空缺――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9eb354d8319cde6646df10d139fc2fedec7da60b1ffcd858dd1eab81243728d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111108.json",
