      "uid": "zhcn:7d6a2be34f6f5c063efce2de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚才我的确被这数字吓得不轻……\n但我告诫自己，应该再认真想一想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc640103b4fb73abdd0076c9e83b205aac48d409691105fbdb3b5f37b9901a11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
