    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95cdeeffa0eb7529b9996d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感谢祭正如其名会有许多粉丝到场。\n如果为了让空中救世主在那里赢得荣耀，\n我也能尽上一分力――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3097ddfa3f609e485c4cdbf2ada211adf1972148f30f17130f966effabdbaa1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
